-- plain.120x40 --
                                                                                                                        
  ∴ REX › HELP                                                                                                    rex v1
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ── Navigation ──────────────────────────────────────────    ── Session commands ────────────────────────────────────  
  j k  move row selection                                     :new                    new-agent wizard                  
  g G  top / bottom                                           :name [text]            rename selected (no text: open    
  tab  next Ready session                                                             editor)                           
  1-4  jump to Ready / Waiting / Working / Done (4 also       :rename <s> <slug>      change slug                       
       folds a long Done column)                              :done [sel]             mark done                         
  v    simple / detailed rows (id, model, tokens, AI          :undone [sel]           undo done                         
       summary)                                               :uc :resume [sel]       undo done: unmark a running       
                                                                                      session, or resume an exited one  
  ── Filter & search ─────────────────────────────────────    :rid [sel]              show the full resume id           
  t     cycle tool filter                                     :undo [sel] [-turns N]  restore the folder to before the  
  /     search the board (every word must match)                                      agent's last turn (asks first)    
  esc   clear the search                                                              (off)                             
  zh    hide / show completed sections                        :redo [sel]             bring back what :undo replaced    
  z1-9  hide / show section N                                                         (off)                             
  z0    show every section                                    :complete [sel]         kill agent + mark done now        
                                                              :rm <sel>               delete                            
  ── Actions ─────────────────────────────────────────────    :prune                  clear Done (keeps sessions still  
  enter  attach to selected session                                                   working)                          
  n      new-agent wizard                                     :export [sel] [fmt]     write session to exports/         
  r      rename selected (empty = slug)                       :loop pause|resume|st…  pause, resume or stop a loop      
  cc     mark done / undo                                                             (stop asks first) (off)           
  uc     undo done (unmark, or resume an exited session)      :loops                  list loops: state, turn, time,    
  C      complete now (kill agent, mark done)                                         last check (off)                  
  dd     delete selected                                      :filter [what]          tool, or hide|show|only           
  i      focus λ prompt (new-session text)                                            <section…>; no argument clears    
  S      settings                                                                     every filter                      
  p      pause / resume the selected loop (off)               :search [text]          search the board (every word      
  x      stop the selected loop (asks first) (off)                                    must match); no text clears       
  L      list loops: state, turn, time, last check (off)                                                                
  q      quit (confirm)                                       ── App commands ────────────────────────────────────────  
                                                              :q :quit         quit (confirm)                           
  ── Mouse ───────────────────────────────────────────────    :q!              force quit                               
  click         select row / filter chip                      :bg :detach      detach, save place                       
  ↓ more                                                                                                                
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  esc close · j/k scroll · / filter                                                                                     
